        "essence_text": "A maximalist, genre-defying explosion of absurdist comedy and kung-fu action that doubles as a deeply moving family drama. The film overwhelms the senses with its kaleidoscopic multiverse, yet never loses sight of the intimate mother-daughter story at its core. It moves effortlessly from laugh-out-loud ridiculousness to profound, tear-jerking catharsis. This is a singular, wildly inventive experience that celebrates empathy, kindness, and the messy, beautiful bonds of family. Few films are this exhaustingly creative or this emotionally devastating in the best possible way."
